            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo ji je m'oyido jodwoko wok i twec jokelo mic awaŋa paka cowirok ri Were pa Isiraili. Jomiyo thwondhe apar g'ario ri Isiraili, wot rombo piero abuŋwen g'aucel, nyithindhi rombo piero ario g'ario, gi diegi apar g'ario paka mic ma cwako reco pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo bende jotero balwa ma kere oyido omiyo jo aka jomiyo jogavana gi jodhum mar'adec ma yuwok ceŋ ma Yufrete, ma bende jomiyo kony pajo ri ji gi Ot pa Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
